%bcond tests 0
Name:           ghc-%{pkg_name}
Version:        0.4.12.0
Release:        1%{?dist}
Summary:        Expands type synonyms in Template Haskell ASTs
License:        BSD-3-Clause
URL:            https://hackage.haskell.org/package/th-expand-syns
Source0:        https://hackage.haskell.org/package/%{pkgver}/%{pkgver}.tar.gz
